window.products.push({"id":197002,"name":"Ventidora 100% Washed Cotton Grey Pillowcase King Size 2 Pack 20x36 inches,Luxury Soft and Comfortable,Anti-Wrinkle, Anti-Fading,Stain Resistant-Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TVp1Mdw0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆PREMIUM PILLOWCASE BENEFITS:Our Grey King 2 Piece Set includes two pillow cases of 20x36 inches (pillows, fitted sheet or bed sheet are not included)100% washed cotton choose 100% cotton as the natural material to make the pillow cover more breathable-Whether you are in the cold winter or warm summer, you can ensure that your head is dry and comfortable sleeping environment all night. ❆PROCESS TECHNOLOGY：Washing cotton is a kind of production process.After the fabric is specially treated,the surface of the fabric will have a softer tone and luster,a softer and more comfortable feel the utility model has the advantages of non-sultry,dry and breathable when used,non-deformation when washing,non-fading and non-ironing.And the texture of old materials is reflected in the slight folds. ❆DETAILS:Bed Pillow Cover features straight-tube closure(NO zipper)which makes it easy to put in or take out the pillow and keep your pillow from slipping out-Pillow cases protect your pillow from being dirty and extend the life of your down pillows.Pillowcase sets can be more convenient by machine washing.King size pillow cases with deep pocket fit snugly on your favorite pillows-Grey pillowcases coordinate effortlessly with patterned comforters,any room decor and match all other Beddings. ❆EASY TO CARE:Machine Washable.only non chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry at low temperature, cool iron if needed..After each wash,The comfortable and breathable duvet cover will become softer. Washed cotton fabrics are characterized by high strength and durability.Resistant to shrinkage,fading and tearing,strong enough to withstand frequent washer and dryer cycles. ❆Guarantee:We promise to provide good customer service.30 Days No Reason To Return Or Exchange,If you have any questions,please feel free to contact us,our customer service staff will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TVp1Mdw0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ventidora","source_asin":"B097K11JKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097K11JKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097K11JKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
