window.products.push({"id":197005,"name":"Diploma Frame with Tassel Holder (Tassel Shadowbox) & Certificate, Document, Degree Frame (2pcs); Diploma Frames 8.5x11 with Mat (Double Matted) Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gDnToZq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL STYLE: To complement the elegance of your diploma, certificate or degree, this lovely dark mahogany wood frame set features a black over gold matte with gold beaded trim, perfect for accenting your document with classy finesse. DOUBLE VALUE: This awesome duo offers you not one, but two document frames, one with a tassel holder! Use one as your high school or college diploma frame or career certificate and the other as a keepsake frame to highlight special memories - your graduation invitation or program, senior photos, Homecoming or prom ticket, etc. HORIZONTAL OR VERTICAL WITH GLASS FRONT: With the clarity of a glass glazing, your document will not only be fully protected, but also clearly visible with no haze or film. Display this 8.5 x 11 wall picture frame in your office or home quickly and safely with secure wall mounting brackets. MULTI-PURPOSE FRAMES: Use for a variety of documents, such as a master’s or bachelor’s college degree graduation frame, a marriage license frame, a professional or cosmetology license frame and more! This is a fantastic gift idea for high school and college graduates or anyone who has earned a professional license or certificate! SATISFACTION GUARANTEED- Rest assured with our 90-day warranty. At RAL Solutions, your satisfaction is our top priority! We package every frame securely in case it endures rough shipping and handling, but if for some reason one or both arrives broken or you are not satisfied, please contact us for a quick resolution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gDnToZq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAL Solutions","source_asin":"B08H57D1XZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H57D1XZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H57D1XZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197006,"name":"Smiry Bathroom Rugs and Mats Set, 2 Piece Chenille Bath Mat and U-Shaped Toilet Rug Set, Non Slip Absorbent Shaggy Bath Rug for Tub, Shower and Bath R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5cunCHKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPER SOFT & COMFORTABLE】: Smiry bathroom rug sets are made of fluffy plush chenille fibers that cloud-like feeling of softness, the foam inside relieves pressure aon your feet and avoid feeling cold from the floor. 【ULTRA-ABSORBENT】: Extra soft fluffy microfiber is super absorbent that helps save your floors from dripping water while you were stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the mat's deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. 【NON-SKID PVC BOTTOM】: Smiry bath rug is made of high quality PVC material, which is much durable for long lasting use, unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. !NOTE: Do not place mat on wet surface. Make sure floors are dry underneath the rug to prevent the rug from slipping. 【MACHINE WASH AND DRY】: Smiry bath mat is easy to clean. Hasten drying by hanging up the mat after each use, or simply leave on the floor to dry. Machine wash with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) tumble dry at low speed or hang dry. 【CREATE YOUR BATHROOM OASIS】: With many different colors to choose from, you will easily find rugs to coordinate with your decor! Plus, If you are at all unsatisfied with your product, please contact us (through Amazon if past the standard return window) and we will be happy to provide you with your choice of a replacement or refund. We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5cunCHKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"smiry","source_asin":"B0BHX1HRHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHX1HRHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHX1HRHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197007,"name":"Brentwood Home Cypress Cooling Gel Memory Foam, Non-Toxic, Made in California Mattress, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJTyMaHfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Brentwood Home mattress provides a medium-firm feel. The 2.5-inch layer of gel infused memory foam responds to your body’s individual shape, weight, and temperature. It adjusts its shape to provide precise support, keeping your spine in alignment while relieving discomfort at pressure points in areas like your hips and shoulders. The infused gel and the ventilated airflow layer evenly disperse heat through the mattress to prevent hot spots that lead to tossing and turning. Our special blend of memory foam actively responds to your movements, allowing you to move freely around the bed without experiencing the quicksand effect. A solid support base absorbs your weight to dampen motion transfer and prevent noise. The mattress is finished in a removable wool-lined zipper cover that stretches in all directions, allowing you to enjoy maximum pressure relief. The wool lining resists odors while it wicks away moisture and regulates body temperature by creating micro-climates. This means that you stay cool in the summer and warm in the winter. The safety of your family is important to us so we only use CertiPUR-US certified foams that are free of flame retardants, formaldehyde, heavy metals, and phthalates. We offer a 25 year warranty as a guarantee of quality. You will be protected from manufacturing defects and premature sagging. We compress and roll our mattresses for easier shipping and setup. Please note that any Brentwood Home Mattress purchased through Amazon is subject to Amazon's 30 day return policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJTyMaHfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood Home","source_asin":"B07SZ9NVVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZ9NVVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZ9NVVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
