window.products.push({"id":197070,"name":"3-in-1 Stainless Steel Bento Box For Adults with Snack Pod - Holds 6 Cups of Food, 100% Crack-Resistant, Secure Locks, Eco-friendly Metal Lunch box Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZHh6ZMhSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ NEW (2023) CRACK-RESISTANT DESIGN: You’ve asked for it, and we’ve delivered; A stainless steel metal bento box that will hold your favorite lunches without splitting at the corners. We’ve given the original GreenLunch Bento a massive facelift; it can now hold your perfectly packed waste-free lunches for life - without cracking, ever! ✅ 50% BIGGER THAN MOST BENTO BOXES: Are you fed up with metal lunch boxes that only accommodate a squished sandwich and a few carrot sticks? If like us, you love feasting over a huge variety at lunchtime - we’ve got good news for you. Our stainless steel lunch container holds over 6 cups of food! That’s 50% more than most metal bento boxes (and one satisfied appetite.) ✅ 3 COMPARTMENTS WITH SNACK POD: Our stainless steel bento lunch box has 3 separate sections to plan your meals perfectly and avoid food mingling. Place your full-sized sandwich in the bottom tier...but don’t stop there! Toss in your pasta, salads, meats, and veggies in the top tier. Oh, and don’t forget the snacks! The removable stainless snack box pod is perfect for fruit, nuts, or thick sauces like yogurt or hummus. ✅ THE SAFEST CHOICE FOR YOUR FAMILY: Our lunch box - made of 100% food-grade stainless steel - is BPA-free, PVC-free, PHTHALATE-free, LEAD-free, and 100% non-leaching. Have peace of mind knowing plastic won’t infiltrate your lunch. The improved snap-secure locks will keep your lunch box secure at work, travel, picnics, or camping. *NOTE: The snap-locks are strong. ✅ BONUS LIFETIME WARRANTY: Rest assured our new and improved crack-free design will store your lunches for life. You will enjoy digging into your favorite foods on-the-go for years to come - and plenty of it, with over 6 cups of capacity. Best of all, our lifetime warranty makes your purchase completely risk-free. Let’s start prepping your yummy lunches. Click the “Buy Now” button right away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZHh6ZMhSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenLunch Bento","source_asin":"B0716B2ZFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0716B2ZFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0716B2ZFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
