window.products.push({"id":197094,"name":"BOLSIUS 10 Inch Grey Taper Candles - 8 Hours Burn Time - Premium European Quality - 10 Pack Unscented Smokeless & Dripless Household Gray Taper Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CeMaRGq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLIMENT ANY SPECIAL OCCASION WITH BOLSIUS GREY CANDLE SET: Our 10 inch long unscented candles improve your home décor without spending a fortune. With these tall candles, you can decorate and add warmth to your house in seconds. Our Gray taper candles are perfect for indoor and outdoor use like wedding ceremonies, parties, candlelight dinner, synagogues, and churches. DRIPLESS CANDLES CRAFTED WITH QUALITY AND CARE - Bolsius tall and beautiful unscented candles are crafted from 100% Paraffin Wax for a pleasant flame. The braided wicks are made up of 100% Cotton, which is carefully dipped numerous times in supreme quality wax, to give it the perfect shine and elegant look. PACK OF 10 MULTIPURPOSE GREY TABLE CANDLE STICKS - The super value pack carries 10 tall, and elegant design chime candles which can be used in commercial decoration or at home decor. Perfect fit for all the standard candlestick and taper candle holders. Our unscented table candles can be used as the centerpiece to enhance weddings, buffet tables, and all events CLEAN BURNING UNSCENTED LONG CANDLES - Our dripless candle stick burns a clean and smooth flame for up to 8 hours. These unscented stick candles are 10-inch long and have a 3/4-inch base diameter. It will provide you a warm and comfortable ambiance during festival times as lent candles, advent candles 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Bolsius always gives priority to customer satisfaction. If for any reason you are unsatisfied with the quality of our dripless taper candles, feel free to contact us, and we'll make things right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CeMaRGq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOLSIUS","source_asin":"B0C3YM6PVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3YM6PVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3YM6PVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197095,"name":"Airdown King Mattress, 10 Inch Memory Foam Mattress in a Box, King Size Mattress Green Tea Gel Foam Infused for Cool Sleep, Medium Firm Mattress King ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":369.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AeM9D6RtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Built For Comfort】With Medium firmness, it’s a great choice for back, side and combination sleepers. The all-foam construction of the Gel Plush mattress is soft and contouring without compromising support. The plush top layers provide lots of pressure relief for achy muscles, joints, and pressure points. It allows your shoulders and hips to fall into the foam, but still follows the curvature of your spine to keep it aligned. 【OPTIMAL SUPPORT FOR YOU】Standing at 10-inch thick, This memory foam mattress is an all-foam layered design, it has multi-layer of the high-end foam that help alleviate pressure points but also properly cradle the spine. The gel memory foam layer helps correctly support your body for exceptional pressure relief no matter what sleeping position you are. And you’ll sleep comfortable throughout all seasons, thanks to the cooling foam wicking away excess heat and moisture. 【ALWAYS PUT SAFETY FIRST】You can sleep on this king bed mattress with confidence because all our bedding are CertiPUR-US certified to ensure performance and safety. The Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover and the gel infusion memory foam quilted cover provide you with naturally skin-friendly sleep surface, and no health risks for you and your family. Get the excellent luxurious experience of deep sleep at night with this breathable foam mattress. 【WELL CONSTRUCTED MATTRESS】Underneath the support layers sits 7\" of high-density foam, provides deep compression support and minimizes motion transfer. It also serves as the foundation for the layers above and provides greater durability and stability to the mattress. The dimension of king mattress is 76'' x 80'' x 14'', works on any solid surface, such as a wood foundation, box spring, slats, the floor or an adjustable base. 【KING MATTRESS IN A BOX】The memory foam mattresses are packaged as a ready-to-ship bed in a box, which are easy to delivery and set-up. Simply unbox and unroll the mattress, expanding to its original shape within 48-72 hours. We make the durable mattresses that will last for many years without any sags and dips, whilst offering consistent pressure relief and superior support and comfort. We give you a 10-year guarantee to show you how confident we are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AeM9D6RtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdown","source_asin":"B0BJKQNHH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJKQNHH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJKQNHH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
