window.products.push({"id":197111,"name":"WINFML 12 Inflatable Wine Bottle Protector for Travel, Wine Botlle Shipping Packaging Airplane Travel, Air Column Cushion Bags with Free Pump","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oAIEB8KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL-ROUND CUSHION PROTECTION: This wine bottle protector is made of durable PE+PA 9 layers of co-extrusion film, reusable box.Wine bottles safe and secure by the air-protect design.These packaging sleeves are the toughest bottle protector on transportation.Durable inflatable column sleeve to avoid deformation and leakage. Protecting wine bottles are better than other materials, packaging paper，peanut and non inflatable bubble bags. EASY TO USE: The package contains 32 bottle bags, an air pump, an inflation operation guide and a zipper bag. Lay the wine bag flat, then look for the arrow line, and finally push the air into the air column. High quality sleeve air cylinder can provide cushioning for your bottle. This is the perfect choice for bottles during travel. Before inflation, they are flat, which saves a lot of space than other materials. SUITABLE FOR 750ML BOTTLES: Suitable for 13 inch high and 3.5 inch diameter bottles. The wine bottle travel bag protects your liquor bottles, glasses, electronic devices, cups, etc. When inflated, it looks like a sleeve to hold the wine bottle in place. INDEPENDENT AIR COLUMNS: Each bottle bag has 14 independent air columns. One column damaged will not have any impact on other columns, and the protective measures are still effective. In the process of transportation and travel, it can effectively prevent the damage of fragile goods. FAST INFLATE: The product is equipped with an inflation pump, and each bag can be successfully inflated within 15 seconds. Inflatable wine bags can maintain air and pressure for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oAIEB8KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINFML","source_asin":"B0BPCKRJNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPCKRJNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPCKRJNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197112,"name":"Window Privacy Film Heat Control Anti UV Matte White Frosted Window Sticker Adhesive Cling Glass Film for Home Bathroom Living Room Office Meeting Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QqGezubHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why choose Kinsolar Frosted Window Cling Film? Advanced Matte Design: 0.28mm ultra-thickness vinyl material and brand-new technology endows this window frosted film with extra durability and special texture. Privacy Protection Level: It can provide you with 100% indoor privacy protection. UV Protection: Blocks 99% of UV rays, protects skin from damage, and reduces furniture fading and aging. Energy Saving: Warm and comfortable in winter, heat insulation in summer, reduce costs, energy saving and environmental protection. How to peel off the protective film? Use two pieces of tape to grab onto one of the corners on each side of the film. Once you start pulling apart the tape, the protective film should start to peel off from the window film itself. How to install? Step 1. Keep Window or Glass clean. Step 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water (Soapy water will be better). Step 3. Remove the adhesive film from protective film (Please make sure you have removed it before you apply the white matte window film to glass). Step 4. When you install it, apply to wet glass and adhesive side. Step 5. Squeegee away air bubbles and redundant water(From top to bottom, from the middle to the sides). Step 6. Cut off the edge and enjoy your work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QqGezubHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinsolar","source_asin":"B07ZQ99QH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQ99QH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQ99QH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
