window.products.push({"id":197122,"name":"FXTNKYY Electric Ceramic Conical Burr Coffee Grinder ，Adjustable Grind Settings， Portable & Travel Friendly Whole Bean Mill，Grind Result Better Taste ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V2w4dZXYL._AC_.jpg","description":"【Conical Burr Grinder is Better Than Blade Grinders】Unlike a blade-based grinder, a burr espresso grinder allows you to grind the beans to a uniform size. The slow grinding process generates minimum heat, so all the coffee oils and flavors are preserved. 【Small Footprint】Petite, quiet and lightweight, our handheld whole bean grinder won’t create clutter on your countertop. Tighten the silicon lid or even take it outside to give the loved ones some extra sleep time. It’s the perfect burr espresso grinder for travel and freshly brewed coffee at home. 【Automatic Grinding】Designed with ceramic grinding burr, hard and durable, hands-free grinding. The coffee grinder electric automatically grinds the exact quantity you need, retains the essence of coffee beans. Grinds 25 grams of coffee beans at a time, about 3 cups 【Customizable Grinding】Accurately control the thickness, turn clockwise to grind to become thinner, and turn counterclockwise to grind to become thicker. Each cup can have a different flavor. Our portable coffee grinder is suitable for most coffee making methods.Such as ltalian coffee（7-15 ticks）, Mocha pot（17-25ticks），drip filter coffee（30-45 ticks），french press cold brew（45-50 ticks）and so on.Adjust the grinding thickness of the coffee beans according to your personal habits. 【Easy to Clean】Cleaning brush included for easy cleanup.Upper chamber, container, and the grinding burr mill inside the grinder can be removed for easy cleaning. They can be cleaned with water provided.（DO NOT wash the motor of the burr mill coffee grinder with water.）","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V2w4dZXYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FXTNKYY","source_asin":"B0BML9WTM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BML9WTM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BML9WTM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
