window.products.push({"id":197196,"name":"Micropuff Zippered Pillow Protectors King - Soft Brushed Microfiber Pillow Covers, Noiseless and Only Quality Fabrics Used Pillowcases with Zipper (4 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AZKkDT4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR PROTECTION – Protect yourself from dust, dirt, and grime and treat yourself with our microfiber pillow protectors. A smooth-gliding, tightly locking zipper completely encases your pillow, providing the ultimate defense against grime. SILKY SOFT MICROFIBER – High quality, non-split microfiber is soft to the touch. Not only will it protect your pillow, it will add a layer of comfort. Microfiber is three times finer than cotton, allowing it be breathable, lightweight and irresistibly soft. WRINKLE FREE – Microfiber is known to have excellent drape, will retain its shape, and will not wrinkle. Not only that, it is one of the most durable fabrics out there. It is also fade resistant, stain resistant and water resistant. Non-split microfiber repels liquids instead of absorbing them. This does not make them waterproof, but it will repel moisture. MACHINE WASHABLE – Putting your pillows in the washing machine is something we all dread. You never know if it will come out lumpy or destroyed. This is where pillow protectors come in handy. You can wash your protectors instead, which will extend the life of your pillow. These pillow protectors are a cinch to wash! They can be washed and dried and will hold up for many washes without shrinking, fading, or tearing. NOISELESS – These pillow protectors are 100% quiet. The plush, super-soft microfiber does not make any noise when you move around. It will keep you cool in the summer and warm in the winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AZKkDT4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICROPUFF","source_asin":"B08639WB3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08639WB3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08639WB3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
