window.products.push({"id":197281,"name":"Wooden Cake Stands | Farm and Wedding Wood Cake Pedestal Stand | Surprise Cake Stand Made of Ash Wood | Size of Rustic Wood Cupcake Stand is 3.5 inche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EWk10fgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you ever used beautiful and sturdy wooden cupcake stands? If you love cupcakes or love to make them then you will love this product. PBR & Companies cupcake stands will make your cupcakes standout more than anything else on your beautiful table. In addition to this, it makes a very unique gift to give to your family and friends. Why choose our Cupcake Stand? Unique Rustic Farmhouse Style made from “Ash” wood. Unique Rustic Farmhouse Style made from “Ash” wood. Sturdy and Durable. Sturdy and Durable. Natural Looking. Natural Looking. Perfect for any event. Perfect for any event. A perfect gift for cupcake lovers. A perfect gift for cupcake lovers. 6 individual pieces. 6 individual pieces. Unique Design We have seen a lot of cupcake stands and the most common thing that we had pointed out was that they were made of metal. We took another approach because on the table, natural materials outshine any other material and which is why we have used wood to give the cupcake stand a very natural look. The wood that we used is “Ash” wood and is known for its strength and durability as compared to “Elm” wood which is a soft wood. Wide Range of Uses The item has a large variety of usages. In addition to cupcakes, you can also hold muffins, small desert or any other small sweat because of its wide 3.5inch base. You can use the stand on any occasion like birthday, wedding, tea party, thanksgiving or any other celebration. It makes a beautiful display of your cupcakes which adds a finishing touch to it. Easy to Clean The wood cake show stand can be washed with gentle cleanser and cold water. We suggest that wood items ought not be drenched and should be altogether dried subsequent to washing. Specifications Material This rusty wooden cupcake stand is made of Ash (wood) which will prevent cracks and breakage Material This rusty wooden cupcake stand is made of Ash (wood) which will prevent cracks and breakage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EWk10fgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PBR & Company","source_asin":"B08Q7PTWXV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7PTWXV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7PTWXV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
