window.products.push({"id":197286,"name":"MARKSIGN Super Soft Velvet Sofa Cover, 100% Waterproof Fabrics with TPU Membrane, Stay Put Design with Non-Slip Backing, Seat Anchors and Removable Ti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JfvNpW5gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF FABRICS-Works like a diaper! Unlike other competing designs, our unique TPU membrane will firmly lock liquid in the padding layer and prevent it seeping through onto your precious furniture. UNIQUE STAY PUT DESIGN-Rubberized silicone rubber dotted backing effectively stops the cover from moving around. Seat anchors tuck into the seams between the frame and seat cushions to keep the cover in place. 8 detachable ties fix the cover firmly onto sofa feet if necessary. Now even the most energetic dogs cannot mess your cover up. SUPER SOFT VELVET-Made of luxury quilted micro velvet with thick 120gsm cotton padding inside, our cover provides super soft and comfortable feeling for both the pets and the people. It is also machine washable and easy to clean. FIVE ROOMY SIDE POCKETS-2 bigger pockets and 3 smaller pockets at the sides to hold remote controls, books, magazines or tablets. IMPORTANT NOTES: 1. Please measure your furniture before purchase! 2. To prevent fabric shrinking, please machine wash with cold gentle circle, tumble dry with no heat and please do not iron. 3. Even though our fabrics are 100% waterproof, liquid may still seep through the seams between the seat piece, the armrest piece and the back piece, so please dry it immediately if large amount of liquid is found there.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JfvNpW5gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARKSIGN","source_asin":"B07MYQJT8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MYQJT8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MYQJT8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197287,"name":"Philips SmartSleep Connected Sleep and Wake-Up Light, Personalized Sunrise and Sunset, SleepMapper App Enabled, Sleep Environment Tracking, HF3670/60","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71btYpNCF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalize your sleep and wake-up experience through sunset and sunrise simulation. Unlike traditional alarm clocks, Philips Wake-up lights use a unique combination of light and sound, which help reduce the time needed to get out of bed. Developed with Philips’ clinical Sleep & Respironics healthcare knowledge and 30 years of leadership in sleep. Join the 92% of users who found it easier to get out of bed.***** Footnotes *Giménez, M. C., Hessels, M., van de Werken, M., de Vries, B., Beersma, D. G. M., & Gordijn, M. C. M. (2010). Effect of artificial dawn on subjective ratings of sleep inertia and dim light melatonin onset. Chronobiology International, 27(6), 1219–1241. Werken MV, Gimenez MC, Vries BD, Beersma DG, EJ Van Someren, Gordijn MC (2010). Effects of artificial dawn on sleep inertia, skin temperature and the awakening cortisol response. Journal of Sleep Research, 19(3), 425-435. Gabel, V., Maire, M., Reichert, C. F., Chellappa, S. L., Schmidt, C., Hommes, V., et al. (2013). Effects of Artificial Dawn and Morning Blue Light on Daytime Cognitive Performance, Well-­‐being, Cortisol and Melatonin Levels. Chronobiology International, 1–10 **Philips WUL Claims Report US Physicians Recontact 071620 N=16, pages 6, 13 ***Giménez, M. C., Hessels, M., van de Werken, M., de Vries, B., Beersma, D. G. M., & Gordijn, M. C. M. (2010). Effect of artificial dawn on subjective ratings of sleep inertia and dim light melatonin onset. Chronobiology International, 27(6), 1219–1241. Werken MV, Gimenez MC, Vries BD, Beersma DG, EJ Van Someren, Gordijn MC (2010). Effects of artifical dawn on sleep inertia, skin temperature and the awakening cortisol response. Journal of Sleep Research, 19(3), 425-435. Norden, M.J., & Avery, D.H. (1993). A controlled study of dawn simulation in subsyndromal winter depression. Acta Psychiatrica Scandinavica, 88(1), 67-71. ****Danilenko K. et al.) ******Metrixlab 2011, N=209 users 1Metrixlab N=109","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71btYpNCF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHILIPS","source_asin":"B09WJJGP6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WJJGP6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WJJGP6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
