window.products.push({"id":197312,"name":"REOMORE Ceramic Dinner Plates Set of 6 with Flower Rim, Porcelain Charger Plates 8.25 inch Scratch and Chip Resistant, Microwave, Oven, Dishwasher Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3yJ0pR1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Design】Inspired by the rose, which symbolizes beauty, fragrance, enthusiasm and love in the United States, we designed the flower rim as the highlight of REOMORE dinner plate. And we layout our unique color matching - ivory white with light green rim, light yellow with light green rim and green with light yellow rim, making main dessert, steak, pasta, salad, Risotto and other main courses more beautiful, delicious, tasty and appetizing. 【Upgraded Technology】 Distinguished of the competitors’ glossy glazed plates, our ceramic salad plates set of 6 with premium matte glazed surface, giving people a soft, quiet and comfortable visual experience, from upgraded glazed technology, make it scratch and chip resistant, you can enjoy in safety the dishes with knives and forks, no worry about leaving marks. 【Durable and Stackable】 With the LEAD and CADIUM FREE, 8.25 inch porcelain steak plates with accidentally featuring speckled dots and the uneven bottom, is designed to stack and nestle nicely in your cupboard or shelves, meanwhile microwavable, freezer, oven, and dishwasher safe. 【Multiple Serving Places】The dinnerware set is a wonderful housewarming present in Christmas, Wedding, Birthday, Anniversary and other meaning days. These decorative service plates instantly transform any dinnerware set into an opulent tablescape for party and special occasions. 【REOMORE‘s Serving Places】 Backed by 60-day worry-free guarantee. Pls contact us in time if any quality problem, so that we can help you ASAP.We do will like to make our products better and better and make every customer satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3yJ0pR1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REOMORE","source_asin":"B0BG4ZWVVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG4ZWVVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG4ZWVVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":197313,"name":"Personalized Custom Basketball on Fire Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Kids Youth Basket Ball Indoor Outdoor Blankets Boys Girls Toddler Mini Hoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M0MHmM1qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M0MHmM1qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07T3DV88B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T3DV88B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T3DV88B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
