window.products.push({"id":197491,"name":"Grazing 12\" Vintage Roman Numeral Design Rustic Country Tuscan Style Wooden Decorative Round Wall Clock (Ocean02)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OLUdyKtJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description :   This is a retro styled analog wall clock made from wood MDF with paper cover. This clock will add charm to any room in your home. There is a plastic shell casing behind the clock for batteries. Only one AA battery is required for this clock (not included). This vintage wall clock can be a good gift at housewarmings, weddings, and social gatherings. Instruction :  1.There is an instruction picture in the last image,please fix hands set with the instrcution. 2.Hands are seperated from the clock for safety of long transportation.You need install them by yourself.Don't worry. Steps are so easy.You just put all the hands on the core shaft in turn,1,Hour hand,2,Minutes hand,3,Second hand. Hands must parallel.Then put 1 AA battery,the clock can work. 3.The clock is unframed and no glass face as the cover.If the touch each other,you can adjust the hands to avoid the hands touching.If the hands drop down,don't worry,they are just loose，just press hands tight on the core shaft to make the hands parallel,then the hands will not drop and will keep time. 4.Sometimes the movement is not work just for the wrong place of the second hand.The red second hand is too deep or too shallow will effect the movement.You can pull the red second hand out and then add it again,then clock work well. Package include :   1* Wooden clock  2* Hands set ( Hour hand,minute hand,second hand) Remark :   * 1.The clock is unframed, and there is no glass face as the cover. * 2.There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness.  * 3.Because the batteries is limited by interenational transport , the battery is no contain, please pay attention.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OLUdyKtJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grazing","source_asin":"B014IPVPHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014IPVPHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014IPVPHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
