window.products.push({"id":197624,"name":"Moscow Mule Copper Mug - Unique Embossed Handcrafted Design - 100% Pure Solid Copper - Perfect Holiday Gift - 16 Oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cpNDfqtGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Satisfaction Guarantee + Great Support We are confident in the quality of our handcrafted copper mug which is why we back it up with a no-hassle 100% money back guarantee. In addition to that, if you need help or support and you contact us, your request will be answered in less than 4 hours. Handcrafted Copper Mug Makes Great Gift For Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Father's Day, Valentine. Perfect gift for groomsmen, grooms, fathers, and boyfriends. Typically, anyone who loves cocktails, ginger beer, liquor and the likes will thank you for a quality copper mug. Unique Embossed Design There are hundreds of same copper mugs on Amazon but why settle for a boring-looking copper mug? That's what sets our copper mug apart. The embossed design on it was done with relaxation and love in mind. The palm trees signifies relaxation and the heart shape they form signifies love. You can't go wrong with that! Sample Moscow Mule Recipe - Ingredients: 4 oz. Ginger beer, 1 1/2 oz. Vodka, 1/6 oz. Lime juice - Preparation: Combine vodka and ginger beer in a copper mug. Add lime juice. Stir gently and garnish with a lime slice. - Served: On the rocks; poured over ice. Three tips to keeping your copper mugs ship shape: * A half of lemon dipped in a bit of salt will polish your copper Moscow mule mugs up in no time and return them to their original splendor. * Double dry * Never put in the dishwasher. ADD TO CART NOW","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cpNDfqtGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tunalt Kitchen","source_asin":"B016SYGJB0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016SYGJB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016SYGJB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
