window.products.push({"id":197709,"name":"Baker Pro Co. Banneton Proofing Basket | Set of 2 | 10 Inch Oval Bread Basket | Perfect Bread Basket For Rising Sourdough Bread with Bread Scraper Too","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ySGTtLIWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're honing your skills as an experienced baker, or you're dabbling into the realm of baking your first homemade sourdough bread, Baker Pro Co will help you achieve your bread baking goals! Our durable and handcrafted rattan basket will ensure that you can make delicious, homemade artisan bread for your friends and loved ones with the highest quality, all-natural rattan cane basket available on the market today. We guarantee an order free, mold free, splinter free basket so your bread baking is hassle free! Experience an easy to use, easy to clean, and reliably constructed proofing basket with handmade craftsmanship to ease your bread proofing process. Whether you bake your bread on a weekly basis or you're taking your first attempt, we want to assure you the complete peace of mind that you may bake your homemade bread for as long as you'd wish or for however many tries it may take! Designed by Bread Bakers, for Bread Bakers Just like you, we are passionate about achieving the perfect homemade artisan bread. After using many unreliable baskets of all sorts, we decided to create our own premium proofing basket in hopes we could share the best baker's experience to the rest of the world. Virtually all of our customers are amazed of how easy it is for the final step of proofing with our brotform. An absolute must-have for the serious Bread Baker. Easy-to-follow Instructions for the Banneton BasketStep 1: Generously coat the basket with flour before letting your dough rest. Keep in mind that you're working with wet dough so to ensure an easy removal a liberal coating is ideal. Step 2: Gently place your kneaded dough into the brotform and add a thin layer of flour to the top of your dough to prevent it from drying out. Step 3: After the dough has risen, transfer the dough onto a baking sheet for the oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ySGTtLIWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baker Pro Co","source_asin":"B089FQY7PY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089FQY7PY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089FQY7PY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
