window.products.push({"id":197856,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, Candle Wax Warmer Plate with Gravity Sensor&3 Temperatures&8H Auto Shut Off, Coffee Mug Warmer for Desk with Night Light, Smart Cof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GZgfh31uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♨[HIGH-END COFFEE CUP WARMER] - Our coffee mug warmer has 3 temperature settings that can keep your beverage, milk, tea, and cocoa warm until you have time to enjoy them. ♨[SAFE DESK CANDLE WARMER] - Our candle warmer plate can melt the wax cubes and release the aroma into the air, without flame, soot, or other pollutants. ♨[SMART GRAVITY SENSOR - There is a gravity sensor button at the back of the VeRosky coffee mug warmers, and it will automatically shut down after 5 minutes after picking up your coffee cup, allowing you to leave your seat at any time without manually turning it off, enjoying a minimalist life. ♨[8H AUTO SHUT OFF] – Our electric coffee cup warmer has an 8h auto-shut-off function, it can prevent any possible safety hazard caused by forgetting to shut down. ♨[3 COLOR BREATHING LIGHT] - 3 kinds of lights mean 3 kinds of temperatures of the mug warmer for desk. At the same time, lights can make it more convenient for you to pick up the coffee cup easily when you use our coffee cup warmer at night. Along with the lights, enjoy your coffee and aromatherapy. ♨[LARGE&WATERPROOF HEATING PANEL] - The coffee mug warmer has oversized and waterproof glass heating panel that can heat up quickly and is suitable for a variety of cup types. And the surface of the glass heating plate is very easy to clean. With 59-inch plug cord will fit on your desk perfectly. ♨[GREAT COFFEE GIFT] - The coffee warmer for desks will be a great coffee gift for your friends as a coffee accessory. tea warmers will be your best gifts for dad, lover, or friends who want nothing on valentine's day, thanksgiving, Christmas, or other special occasions. ❣[NOTE] - The VeRosky coffee mug warmer does not support boiling liquids. This temperature we design according to the health needs of the human body. So don't expect it to heat your drink very hot like a microwave or a kettle. ❣[TIP 1] - A thin-walled, flat-bottomed mug will have the best warmth-retaining performance. ❣[TIP 2] - Your 100% satisfaction is our top priority. Just set your mind at rest to purchase our mug warmer. Any problems please feel free to contact us. For more information on how to use the coffee warmer, please scroll down to get User Instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GZgfh31uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeRosky","source_asin":"B0C4YVSS28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YVSS28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YVSS28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
