window.products.push({"id":197859,"name":"Gomyrod Incense Holder for Sticks [Anti-Ash Flying] Metal Insence-Stick Holder Incense Burner with 9 Incense-Holes Holder Ideal for Home Decor - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rzncC1MDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design - Gomyrod Incense holder is made of high-quality aluminum alloy, solid and durable. The insense-stick holder is designed with a detachable ash catcher and metal body. The ash will fall vertically into the incense holder ash catcher and won't make a mess. (Please try to adjust the incense stick to make sure it's vertical to avoid touching the tube wall and causing the incense to go out.) Easy to Clean - The metal body can be taken out from the ash catcher and the smooth inside does not stick to ash. Only need to open the cover and pour the ash into your trash and wash it with water to keep it as new. Detachable Ash Catcher - The ash catcher can be detached from the stick holder, size 2.55 x 2.55 x 1.37 inches. The incense burner bottom part is larger enough to be used with incense cones or incense sticks. To avoid a lack of oxygen when lighting incense, we punch a small hole at the bottom of the tube wall for ventilation. Suitable for Various Incense - 9-hole incense stand allows it to hold a variety of incense like Indian incense, Japanese incense, etc. And the circular body is long enough for all standard incense sticks, perfectly avoiding ash falling around the desk. Package Includes - 1pcs metal incense holder set, 1pcs 9-hole incense stand. Gomyrod incense cone holder makes it an ideal gift for those who love aromatherapy and an attractive addition to your home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rzncC1MDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gomyrod","source_asin":"B0BN3L7DRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-197859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3L7DRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3L7DRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
