window.products.push({"id":198001,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 28Kpa 300W Brushless Stick Vacuum with 2 Batteries, Up to 90min Runtime, 10-in-1 Powerful Rechargeable Lightweight Cordl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716KhqcNSkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 DETACHABLE BATTERIES & UP TO 90 MINS RUNTIME】The rechargeable vacuum cordless features a 2500 m-A-h larger capacity battery (8 cells), this pet vacuum offers longer working time than other cordless vacuum cleaner. Up to 90mins in total at standard mode, ensures thorough deep cleaning all around the house 【28KPA POWERFUL SUCTION & 300W BRUSHLESS MOTOR】The stick vacuum is equipped with 2023 upgraded digital motors, 150 AW suction power, and 28Kpa suction force with 2 modes, up to 90 mins on standard mode, 45 mins on max mode. This vacuum cordless perfectly performs on hardwood floors, carpets, stairs, curtains, cars, furniture, etc. 65 dB low noise peacefully cleaning with less disturbance to your family 【10 COMBINATIONS-MEET ALL CLEANING NEEDS】This Vacuum Cleaner comes with a flexible hose, retractable metal tube, long crevice, 2-in-1 brush, motorized brush, and mini motorized brush, which can be assembled into 10 Combinations. It can be assembled arbitrarily for easy cleaning of stairs, car interior, curtains, and other hard-to-reach places. Meet all your daily cleaning needs. Lightweight design allows you to operate with one hand effortlessly. 【5 STAGES HIGH-EFFICIENCY FILTRATION SYSTEM】The cordless stick vacuum is equipped with 5 stages fully-sealed filtration system with a sponge filter,strong cyclone, HEPA filter,mesh filter,and stainless steel strainer,captures 99.99% of the microscopic dust, ensures stronger suction.The difference between the S6P and S6P Pro cordless vacuum is the Filtration System,S6P Pro adopts a more efficient HEPA filter, filters more thoroughly, reduce the loss of suction,and the user experience is better. 【FLEXIBAL MOTORIZED LED FLOOR HEAD & TWO ROLLERS】INSE S6P Pro cordless vacuum cleaner has extra-wide motorized floor brush with tangle-free design, and big anti-scratch wheels provide easier cleaning. 4 LED lights illuminates every dark corner and helps you to track dust. The stiff roller helps roll up the debris embedded in the carpets, and the soft roller with anti-static fiber protects hard floors. 【LIGHTWEIGHT & TWO STORAGE AND CHARGING WAYS】The Main Body only weighs 3.3lbs, can quickly become a handheld vacuum cleaner for ceiling cleaning. The lightweight vacuum cleaner support 2 easy storage methods: Self-standing design and compact wall-hanging design. Effectively save space, improve life comfort. This cordless vacuum will be an excellent gift for your family or friends. No worry about after-sales, we offer 12-month 100% satisfactory after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716KhqcNSkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C53MLW8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C53MLW8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C53MLW8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
